 "en-US-RogerNeural\u0000A fund can look full of cash, but much of that money is already committed. So Fadi tracks both numbers. He knows how much money the fund has already promised, and how much stays truly free. With many grants, little free cash, and countless rules, the work is complex.":{f:"c72cf51ba1bc13ac",d:20.520,v:0.981,a:0.160,b:19.480,wd:[0.2, 0.4, 0.68, 1.08, 1.44, 1.76, 1.92, 2.44, 2.64, 2.99, 3.21, 3.57, 4.0, 4.21, 4.79, 5.48, 5.8, 6.15, 6.56, 7.01, 7.65, 7.84, 8.3, 8.58, 8.94, 9.36, 9.66, 10.01, 10.28, 10.87, 11.59, 11.96, 12.16, 12.52, 12.95, 13.38, 13.84, 14.17, 14.53, 15.1, 15.68, 15.92, 16.39, 16.68, 17.39, 17.9, 18.18, 18.44, 18.8],e:"00000eoH00RtpUPH0QNLKTR0000LUKLUG000NWXSKFD0ED000000000000000loKNQhqjEGMSEWolNEILYYROLKLMFITUWWWMMG0FILQQIJG0000000000000000000000EZvlP00Z+-",w:"00-v-Zak--kWcb7K-RLBBUUch--IIKENJf--bbYYUeg----bVqql--xsdc--lPWGDGQgdx-rQLQZYP66BOWUTgZZN--MJGIPSiZ-yD5SXcUXUISq---000000------Z---cWSH--GNTbbpig--bQXcac---WoNKLQq-ZKTN93GDEc-------00000000000--z-hhA7lhTNIQ--ZXWPLQdZ--k6LSbUkhZENRL---IRWZeCWXR---LJHGLPbcKU-HNPK8BOL-------XUvq-yzyrn-nnHfffcNNXgX----Shjmg-----BDKQOcW---NCJReSOLHY----------------hBXWb8AscobI-FCLZfdUAh----wwnr+loh+Wp-IXfQOE---GNXZ--cgcVXjl------q+-mgX-jSjctsC6--XgbRDQXq--f6BGHHHKHK---kvoevXkjy-RD6CGJLS-YX----I4-wfISXZr------v---00000000000000000",r:"--060SRH00HVPQuh0agqqXXPK00jjhneiM00QQTTXNL0000QWBBG0049OP00GcVlolbLO40AbgbSTcvvqdVXYLSSe00filjcZJS03owZUPXUXjZB000------000000S000PVZk00leYQQCJL00QbUPRP000VDehgbB0ShYesylonP0000000----------------------------"},
